Rommio patch for Azahar (applied after azahar.patch): emulates the New 3DS movie decoder,
mvd:STD (Hantro G1's H.264 decoder and postprocessor), decoding with VideoToolbox on Apple
platforms. See docs/ios-3ds-mvd.md.

This patch was written with Claude, an AI model. Azahar's AI-POLICY.md prohibits AI-written
contributions of this size, so it must not be submitted to Azahar.

